    "notes": "Inspected 70 current frames: 13 portable, 13 shared-material/geographic, 25 medium-fi and 19 native. The bent narrow deck, seven true arch openings (including the larger western span), solid parapets/coping, six individually mapped pointed cutwaters, six slatted wooden ice guards and four independent sculpture ensembles are present. Calvary has a metal crucifix and three stone companions; Nepomuk has a biretta, five-star halo and two full angels; Anne has young Mary and infant Jesus; Anthony carries a child. Corrected textured masonry joints on carved figures, missing Anne infant and buried angel bodies during the same build pass. Far levels intentionally simplify small sculpture and fittings."
  },
